P Module 2.5G C++++ is a high-performance optical transceiver designed for Gigabit Passive Optical Networks (GPON). With a 2.5Gbps downstream and 1.25Gbps upstream data rate, this module ensures fast and reliable communication for FTTH (Fiber to the Home) and enterprise fiber access networks.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Featuring a powerful C++++ optical transmitter with 9dBm output, it supports long-distance transmission up to 20km or more over single-mode fiber (SMF). Designed for OLT (Optical Line Terminal) applications, this hot-pluggable SFP module uses an SC connector and complies with industry GPON standards.</span></div><h3><br></h3><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">High-Speed Data Rates: 2.5Gbps downstream / 1.25Gbps upstream</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Optical Power Output: 9dBm (C++++ class) for extended reach</span></li><li>Transmission Distance: Up to 20km+ over SMF</li><li>Connector Type: SC/UPC</li><li>Wavelength: 1490nm (TX) / 1310nm (RX)</li><li>GPON OLT Compatible: Ideal for ISPs, telecoms, and FTTH deployments</li><li>Low Power Consumption &amp; Hot-Pluggable SFP Form Factor</li><li>High Stability and Reliability in demanding network environments</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n    